 what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\" style=\"max-width:420px\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N</div>\n      <h1 class=\"h2\">Welcome back</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Sign in to your Northwind account to view your dashboard and pick up where you left off.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <form id=\"login\" class=\"card stack\" novalidate>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Sign in</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Enter your work email and password.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"err\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" role=\"alert\" hidden>Please enter a valid email and a password of at least 8 characters.</div>\n      <div id=\"ok\" class=\"alert\" role=\"status\" hidden>Signed in successfully. Redirecting to your dashboard…</div>\n\n      <label>Email\n        <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:.25rem\">\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <span class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:500\">Password</span>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"small muted\">Forgot password?</a>\n        </div>\n        <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required aria-label=\"Password\">\n        <label class=\"check small muted\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show\"> Show password</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"remember\" checked> Remember me for 30 days</label>\n\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block\">Sign in</button>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\">Sign in with single sign-on</button>\n    </form>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted center\" style=\"text-align:center\">Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\">Request access</a><br>Protected by encrypted connection. Only use \"Remember me\" on trusted devices.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const f = document.getElementById('login');\n  const err = document.getElementById('err');\n  const ok = document.getElementById('ok');\n  document.getElementById('show').addEventListener('change', e => {\n    document.getElementById('password').type = e.target.checked ? 'text' : 'password';\n  });\n  f.addEventListener('submit', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const em = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();\n    const pw = document.getElementById('password').value;\n    const valid = /^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test(em) && pw.length >= 8;\n    err.hidden = valid;\n    ok.hidden = !valid;\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[1925,"<div class=\"page\""],[2241," style=\"max-width:"],[2249,"420px\">"],[2249,"\n  "],[2249,"<div class=\"stack gap"],[2249,"-lg\">\n    <div"],[2249," class=\"st"],[2249,"ack center\""],[2249," style=\"text-align:center\">"],[2249,"\n      <div class=\"avat"],[2251,"ar\" a"],[2285,"ria-hidden=\"true\">"],[2317,"N"],[2600,"</div>\n      <h1"],[2600," "],[2600,"class=\"h2"],[2600,"\">Welcome back</"],[2600,"h1>\n      <p class"],[2600,"=\"muted\">